From 9f6bf995c0e803700d99473a32bc8a389f48435b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michel JAOUEN <michel.jaouen@st.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Apr 2024 10:41:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 836/913] product: add tfm-stm32mp2 product.

Since only stm32mp2 platform is targeted for scp support
in tfm , all the modules are product specific. The product definition is
based on optee stm32mp2 product.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git b9107cb089f04d34a6dac194b840ea7effa537e2 product: add tfm-stm32mp2 product.]
